   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "So I have heard. At one time the Buddha was staying near Sāvatthī in Jeta’s Grove, Anāthapiṇḍika’s monastery."
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Then, late at night, a glorious deity, lighting up the entire Jeta’s Grove, went up to the Buddha, bowed, and stood to one side."
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "That deity addressed the Buddha in verse:"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "“Many gods and humans"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "have thought about blessings"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "desiring well-being:"
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "declare the highest blessing.”"
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "“Not to fraternize with fools,"
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "but to fraternize with the wise,"
    },
    {
     "n": 10,
     "text": "and honoring those worthy of honor:"
    },
    {
     "n": 11,
     "text": "this is the highest blessing."
    },
    {
     "n": 12,
     "text": "Living in a suitable region,"
    },
    {
     "n": 13,
     "text": "having made merit in the past,"
    },
    {
     "n": 14,
     "text": "being rightly resolved in oneself,"
    },
    {
     "n": 15,
     "text": "this is the highest blessing."
    },
    {
     "n": 16,
     "text": "Education and a craft,"
    },
    {
     "n": 17,
     "text": "discipline and training,"
    },
    {
     "n": 18,
     "text": "and well-spoken speech:"
    },
    {
     "n": 19,
     "text": "this is the highest blessing."
    },
    {
     "n": 20,
     "text": "Caring for mother and father,"
    },
    {
     "n": 21,
     "text": "kindness to children and partners,"
    },
    {
     "n": 22,
     "text": "and unstressful work:"
    },
    {
     "n": 23,
     "text": "this is the highest blessing."
    },
    {
     "n": 24,
     "text": "Giving and righteous conduct,"
    },
    {
     "n": 25,
     "text": "kindness to relatives,"
    },
    {
     "n": 26,
     "text": "blameless deeds:"
    },
    {
     "n": 27,
     "text": "this is the highest blessing."
    },
    {
     "n": 28,
     "text": "Desisting and abstaining from evil,"
    },
    {
     "n": 29,
     "text": "avoiding drinking liquor,"
    },
    {
     "n": 30,
     "text": "diligence in good qualities:"
    },
    {
     "n": 31,
     "text": "this is the highest blessing."
    },
    {
     "n": 32,
     "text": "Respect and placidity,"
    },
    {
     "n": 33,
     "text": "contentment and gratitude,"
    },
    {
     "n": 34,
     "text": "and timely listening to the teaching:"
    },
    {
     "n": 35,
     "text": "this is the highest blessing."
    },
    {
     "n": 36,
     "text": "Patience, being easy to admonish,"
    },
    {
     "n": 37,
     "text": "the sight of ascetics,"
    },
    {
     "n": 38,
     "text": "and timely discussion of the teaching:"
    },
    {
     "n": 39,
     "text": "this is the highest blessing."
    },
    {
     "n": 40,
     "text": "Fervor and chastity"
    },
    {
     "n": 41,
     "text": "seeing the noble truths,"
    },
    {
     "n": 42,
     "text": "and realization of extinguishment:"
    },
    {
     "n": 43,
     "text": "this is the highest blessing."
    },
    {
     "n": 44,
     "text": "Though touched by worldly conditions,"
    },
    {
     "n": 45,
     "text": "their mind does not tremble;"
    },
    {
     "n": 46,
     "text": "sorrowless, stainless, secure:"
    },
    {
     "n": 47,
     "text": "this is the highest blessing."
    },
    {
     "n": 48,
     "text": "Having completed these things,"
    },
    {
     "n": 49,
     "text": "undefeated everywhere;"
    },
    {
     "n": 50,
     "text": "everywhere they go in safety:"
    },
    {
     "n": 51,
     "text": "this is their highest blessing.”"
    }
   ],
   "variant": "translation"
  }
 ]
}
